+AETHELBORN ASCENDED v0.25.200 - WIND RINGS AND BIRD TARGETS
+Use INSTALL.bat as usual. Includes the previous v199 pass and its earlier fixes.
+
+This pass covers exactly the seven current requests: ground downwash for Whirlwind, strong wind rings for Circle Swing, Fury cooldown chevrons, 20% max-HP initial Holy Wave healing, class-colored airy rings for damaging support pulses, embedded relic gems/hearts, and native bird target/damage support.
+
