+
+Read TEST_THIS_BUILD.txt before testing; CHANGELOG_v0.25.200.txt explains changes and TEST_RESULTS_v0.25.200.txt states what was checked. This remains the source-installer distribution. Compilation/tests were performed outside Unity; no in-game or Windows installer run is claimed.
+
